2966, "y0": 0.2463092463092463, "x1": 0.6945054945054945, "y1": 0.2595182595182595}, {"text": "analyse, explain and assess the ways human experiences are represented in texts", "x0": 0.22967032967032966, "y0": 0.26573426573426573, "x1": 0.8736263736263736, "y1": 0.2789432789432789}, {"text": "Question 1 (3 marks)", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.3123543123543124, "x1": 0.2956043956043956, "y1": 0.3247863247863248}, {"text": "Text 1\u2014 Poem", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.34032634032634035, "x1": 0.24175824175824176, "y1": 0.34965034965034963}, {"text": "How does the poet represent the joy of togetherness? 3", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.3690753690753691, "x1": 0.8549450549450549, "y1": 0.3822843822843823}, {"text": "Section I continues on page 3", "x0": 0.3758241758241758, "y0": 0.8593628593628594, "x1": 0.6230769230769231, "y1": 0.8725718725718725}], [{"text": "Question 2 (4 marks)", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.08857808857808858, "x1": 0.2956043956043956, "y1": 0.10178710178710179}, {"text": "Text 2 - Letter", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.1250971250971251, "x1": 0.24835164835164836, "y1": 0.13442113442113443}, {"text": "\u2018Analyse how the father shares his personal experience of and advice about love. 4", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.1592851592851593, "x1": 0.856043956043956, "y1": 0.17249417249417248}, {"text": "Section I continues on page 4", "x0": 0.3758241758241758, "y0": 0.7871017871017871, "x1": 0.6230769230769231, "y1": 0.8003108003108003}], [{"text": "Question 3 (4 marks)", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.08857808857808858, "x1": 0.2956043956043956, "y1": 0.10178710178710179}, {"text": "Text 3 \u2014 Non-fiction postscript", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.11732711732711733, "x1": 0.3824175824175824, "y1": 0.13053613053613053}, {"text": "Explore how the speaker reflects on the importance of handling personal stories with care. 4", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.1452991452991453, "x1": 0.8725274725274725, "y1": 0.1585081585081585}, {"text": "Section I continues on page 5", "x0": 0.3758241758241758, "y0": 0.846930846930847, "x1": 0.6230769230769231, "y1": 0.8601398601398601}], [{"text": "Question 4 (3 marks)", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.08857808857808858, "x1": 0.2956043956043956, "y1": 0.10178710178710179}, {"text": "Text 4 \u2014 Prose fiction extract", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.12432012432012432, "x1": 0.36813186813186816, "y1": 0.13442113442113443}, {"text": "Analyse how Harold\u2019s kindness challenges the collective attitudes in the brewery. 3", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.1592851592851593, "x1": 0.845054945054945, "y1": 0.17249417249417248}, {"text": "Section I continues on pages 6 and 7", "x0": 0.34615384615384615, "y0": 0.804972804972805, "x1": 0.6538461538461539, "y1": 0.8181818181818182}], [{"text": "Question 5 (6 marks)", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.08857808857808858, "x1": 0.2956043956043956, "y1": 0.10101010101010101}, {"text": "Text 5 AND Text 1 OR 2 OR 3 OR 4 \u2014 Discursive article AND Poem OR Letter OR", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.1250971250971251, "x1": 0.8340659340659341, "y1": 0.13442113442113443}, {"text": "Non-fiction postscript OR Prose fiction extract", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.14219114219114218, "x1": 0.521978021978022, "y1": 0.15462315462315462}, {"text": "Compare how composers represent the way in which unique environments shape human", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.1717171717171717, "x1": 0.832967032967033, "y1": 0.18492618492618493}, {"text": "behaviour.", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.18803418803418803, "x1": 0.20549450549450549, "y1": 0.19813519813519814}, {"text": "In your response, make detailed reference to Text 5 AND Text 1 OR 2 OR 3 OR 4. 6", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.216006216006216, "x1": 0.856043956043956, "y1": 0.22921522921522922}], [{"text": "Question 5 (continued)", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.08857808857808858, "x1": 0.3054945054945055, "y1": 0.1017